    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "letter_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Hi, lovely — girl to girl." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "letter_body", "label": "Body", "default": "<p>We made herprint for the girl who's always becoming something — softer, braver, a little more herself. Our whole little world runs on one line: <em>jewelry that marks your every becoming.</em></p><p>And we think that's you. So here's our invite, plain and simple: we'd love to send you a piece, on us. Not a random one off a list — one we pick because it feels like <em>your</em> vibe.</p><p>Wear it on whatever expresses you most — your everyday, your big day, your quiet days. And if it makes your heart smile, share it with your people, however feels natural to you. No script, no stiff rules. Just you, and a little gold that's now part of your story. ✦</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "letter_sign", "label": "Signature", "default": "— with love, the herprint team" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "3 · The gift" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "gift_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "What you'll receive" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "gift_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "A gift, chosen just for you." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "gift_card1_title", "label": "Card 1 title", "default": "Picked for your vibe" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "gift_card1_text", "label": "Card 1 text", "default": "We don't pull a name off a list. We look at <em>you</em> — your colours, your everyday, the way you put yourself together — and choose a piece that already feels like it belongs to you." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "gift_card2_title", "label": "Card 2 title", "default": "A little blind box" },
